/* msdd_assets.js — wall textures for Dungeon Delve.
   Kept out of the main file so the game itself stays small and readable.
   Loaded with a <script> tag rather than fetched, because fetch() is blocked
   on file:// and the game has to keep opening by double-click.
   If this file is missing the game still runs: walls fall back to procedural
   masonry.

   v4.9: the miniature renders made from STL files are no longer shipped here.
   They are on the back burner until the original sculptors give permission;
   every figure in the game is drawn from the shared minis library instead. */

/* CC0 textures from 3dtextures.me, desaturated and downscaled to 192px tiles.
   Only the basecolor maps are used; Canvas 2D has no use for normal or
   roughness. 59kb of JPEG rather than 660kb of PNG. */
